# ==============================================================================
# Claude & Anthropic 本地黑洞拦截列表 (Claude Blackhole Hosts)
# 作用: 拦截本机所有程序对 Claude / Anthropic 的直接联网行为，杜绝多出口漏网与 DNS 泄露
# 包含 IPv4 (127.0.0.1) 与 IPv6 (::1) 双栈拦截，防止 Happy Eyeballs 经 IPv6 绕过黑洞
# 配合 VPS 内网代理（Tailscale + HTTP/SOCKS5）使用：代理在远端解析 DNS，本机 hosts 拦截不影响代理通道
# ==============================================================================

# --- Anthropic 官方核心域 (IPv4 + IPv6) ---
127.0.0.1 anthropic.com
::1       anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 www.anthropic.com
::1       www.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 api.anthropic.com
::1       api.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 console.anthropic.com
::1       console.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 docs.anthropic.com
::1       docs.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 support.anthropic.com
::1       support.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 status.anthropic.com
::1       status.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 research.anthropic.com
::1       research.anthropic.com
127.0.0.1 platform.anthropic.com
::1       platform.anthropic.com

